# Rosalyn - Unified Interactive Visit & Tambayan Smalltalk Timeline
# Fires frequently while intangible (Ch. 1-5) and while waiting on Brahim/Danilo prerequisites!
# Voice: Ultra-shy 2-to-7 word whispers nudged gently by the player.

label Greeting
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	Rosalyn: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}

if {Transaction_Chapter} < 6.0:
	Rosalyn: ...
	- Resting near the bulb?
		if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 50:
			Rosalyn: Warm here, po.
		else:
			Rosalyn: Just a minute, po.
	- Quiet out on the road?
		if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 50:
			Rosalyn: Stray cat looked at me, po.
		else:
			Rosalyn: Keeping my sleeves down, po.
else:
	if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34:
		Rosalyn: Just resting in the light, po.
	elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67:
		Rosalyn: Puddles look calm outside, po.
	else:
		Rosalyn: Good day, po.
	- Stay as long as you like.
		Rosalyn: Salamat po.
	- Peaceful out there?
		Rosalyn: Very quiet, po.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Smalltalk
if {Transaction_Chapter} < 6.0:
	if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34:
		Rosalyn: Crickets sound loud from here, po.
	elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67:
		Rosalyn: Candy jars still catch the light, po.
	else:
		Rosalyn: Thank you for seeing me, po.
else:
	if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34:
		Rosalyn: Bench feels solid under my hand, po.
	elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67:
		Rosalyn: Sampaguita still smells like rain, po.
	else:
		Rosalyn: Rest your feet too, po.
[end_timeline]
